		{
			dependencies: ["19AC0B8C0B44FA30"]
			description: [
				"&4Grisha&r, you know a lot about sanguines, right?"
				""
				"&4While I've been collecting dust on a shelf for years, I did serve your grandfather and your mother when she was a child."
				""
				"You know them more than I do... How am I supposed to raise my sanguine power? I don't want to let those artificial vampires running about teach me false information."
				""
				"&4Well, let's see what I can spit out here."
			]
