		{
			dependencies: ["47A72E03EBA8A7ED"]
			description: [
				"&4Raising your initial power is simple. An altar of inspiration can help you channel blood within your body with the power of moonlight. Pour blood bottles into it and infuse yourself with sanguine strength at night! "
				""
				"&4You can only really strengthen by a few levels this way, you will need a stronger ritual in the future. I can estimate around.. hm... 20 bottles of blood would be needed?"
			]
