		{
			dependencies: ["47A72E03EBA8A7ED"]
			description: [
				"&4You, young sanguine, have the uncanny ability of simply not dying. Most humans call it ressurection. It isn't quite true resurrection, as your body falls and gradually mends itself over time. Most creatures will believe you are truly dead and leave you alone in this state."
				""
				"Then I can always come back, forever?"
				""
				"&4No, no, no. Once you have revived, you will be in a vulnerable state where it is easier for you to die permanently. Then, humans have various methods of causing holy damage to your body, whether it be stakes, silver, fire, or even garlic... Then, you will not be able to come back."
			]
			entity_vis_size: 1.0f
			id: "3FEE19387DC6BD6E"
			rewards: [
